This package provides a generator-neutral light-dark-matter event record
(ldmgen/1 HDF5), adapters, comparison tools, a HepMC3/LdmHepMC public layer,
and HEPEVT sinks. Optional exporters call the separate public packages:

- bdnmc-nova (https://github.com/RobMina/bdnmc-nova) — NOvA HEPEVT writers
- bdnmc-dune (https://github.com/RobMina/bdnmc-dune) — DUNE edep-sim HEPEVT writers
- BdNMC / bdnmc-jax (https://github.com/RobMina/BdNMC) — reference generator and scatter physics

NOvA-internal geometry, surveyed ND placement, private frame JSON, FCL, and
site paths are not part of this repository. They stay in collaboration-private
areas and in the separate private generator workspace (ldm-generators) / UVA
project space when those exist.

Related packages (not merged here):
- nova-fastsim (https://github.com/RobMina/nova-fastsim) — NOvA ND fastsim shell; consumes ldmgen
- bdnmc-nova / bdnmc-dune — experiment chain sinks
